WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:17.791
Riley: Today is the eighth meeting of the Pet Lovers Club!

2
00:00:17.792 --> 00:00:20.157
Sarah: Where's Theo?

3
00:00:20.158 --> 00:00:24.183
Ben: Here he is.

4
00:00:24.184 --> 00:00:28.929
Theo: Hi, everyone! I was at the sports store.

5
00:00:28.930 --> 00:00:32.024
Theo: My mom bought me a new soccer ball.

6
00:00:32.025 --> 00:00:34.223
Skyler: I'm playing soccer too.

7
00:00:34.224 --> 00:00:36.312
Which team are you on?

8
00:00:36.313 --> 00:00:39.531
Theo: I'm on Coach Ryan's team.

9
00:00:39.532 --> 00:00:42.121
Skyler: I'm on the same team!

10
00:00:42.122 --> 00:00:44.044
Riley: So am I.

11
00:00:44.045 --> 00:00:47.287
We'll play at the park on Saturday.

12
00:00:47.288 --> 00:00:49.245
Skyler: I'm so nervous.

13
00:00:49.246 --> 00:00:51.788
It's my first soccer game.

14
00:00:51.789 --> 00:00:55.481
Skyler: I really want to score a goal!

15
00:00:55.482 --> 00:00:58.607
Sarah: I'll bring Mittens and cheer for your team.

16
00:00:58.608 --> 00:01:01.169
Sarah: I bought him a pretty blue ribbon.

17
00:01:01.170 --> 00:01:06.875
Chatter: Blue, blue, blue!

18
00:01:06.876 --> 00:01:08.330
Skyler: Bad boy, Chatter!

19
00:01:08.331 --> 00:01:12.749
Don't peck at Mittens' new ribbon.

20
00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:16.310
Ben: Chatter must like the color blue.

21
00:01:16.311 --> 00:01:18.154
Skyler: Yes, he does.

22
00:01:18.155 --> 00:01:22.226
He pecked two blue buttons off my dress.

23
00:01:22.227 --> 00:01:25.238
Chatter: Go, team!

24
00:01:25.239 --> 00:01:30.091
Skyler: Chatter has been watching soccer on TV.

25
00:01:30.092 --> 00:01:32.516
Theo: That gives me an idea.

26
00:01:32.517 --> 00:01:34.665
Riley: What?

27
00:01:34.666 --> 00:01:37.766
Theo: Chatter can be our team mascot.

28
00:01:37.767 --> 00:01:41.118
Sarah: What's a mascot?

29
00:01:41.119 --> 00:01:44.494
Ben: A mascot brings a team good luck.

30
00:01:44.495 --> 00:01:47.736
Skyler: Chatter is very good luck!

31
00:01:47.737 --> 00:01:50.917
Skyler: I'm going to practice every day after school.

32
00:01:50.918 --> 00:01:53.688
I want our team to win!

33
00:01:53.689 --> 00:01:57.719
Riley: This is going to be fun.

34
00:01:57.720 --> 00:02:00.787
Theo: I can't wait until Saturday.

35
00:02:00.788 --> 00:02:08.091
Skyler: Me neither. With Chatter on our side, we'll win for sure!
